      "AreaOfCircleOQ02OQ01.lean:52 — sqrt_pi_pow_eq: (√π)^n = π^(n/2)",
      "AreaOfCircleOQ02OQ01.lean:65 — nball_volume_scaling_theorem: for n≥1, r≥0",
      "AreaOfCircleOQ02OQ01.lean:103 — area_2ball_scaling: Vol(B²(r)) = πr²",
      "AreaOfCircleOQ02OQ01.lean:113 — vol_3ball_scaling: Vol(B³(r)) = 4πr³/3",
      "AreaOfCircleOQ02OQ01.lean:123 — negative example: axiom false at n=0,r=0"
    ],
    "insights": [
      "Mathlib's EuclideanSpace.volume_ball uses √π^n/Γ(n/2+1) while gallery uses π^(n/2)/Γ(n/2+1); these are equal by (√π)^n = π^(n/2)",
      "EuclideanSpace.volume_ball requires [Nonempty ι], limiting to n ≥ 1",
      "Parent axiom nball_volume_scaling is false at n=0, r=0: 0^0=1 in ℝ but ball(0,0)=∅ has measure 0",
      "ENNReal.ofReal_pow and ofReal_mul are the key lemmas for bridging ENNReal and ℝ arithmetic"
    ],
